{"id":"wb-2-6","name":"西安事变旧址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"西安事变旧址","text":"西安事变旧址，位于陕西省西安市，是西安事变的纪念地。包括张学良公馆、杨虎城止园别墅、新城黄楼、西安事变指挥部、西京招待所、高桂滋公馆、五间厅、兵谏亭八处建筑。\n在碑林区建国路69号的张学良公馆设有西安事变纪念馆。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%A5%BF%E5%AE%89%E4%BA%8B%E5%8F%98%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80","revisionId":92429994,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92429994","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/aa97ab8d0d619823260c3d23.jpg","title":"西安事变旧址（系列）-高桂滋公馆 - panoramio.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E8%A5%BF%E5%AE%89%E4%BA%8B%E5%8F%98%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80%EF%BC%88%E7%B3%BB%E5%88%97%EF%BC%89-%E9%AB%98%E6%A1%82%E6%BB%8B%E5%85%AC%E9%A6%86_-_panoramio.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/76/%E8%A5%BF%E5%AE%89%E4%BA%8B%E5%8F%98%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80%EF%BC%88%E7%B3%BB%E5%88%97%EF%BC%89-%E9%AB%98%E6%A1%82%E6%BB%8B%E5%85%AC%E9%A6%86_-_panoramio.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"鲍向阳","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"西安事变旧址（系列）---高桂滋公馆","width":320,"height":213,"matchEvidence":"对应 Wikidata P373 专属相册：Sites of the Xi'an Incident","categorySourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Sites_of_the_Xi%27an_Incident"}}